('c0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa', 'd4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444', 'This makes total sense now! Does Java support multiple inheritance with polymorphism?'),
('c0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa', 'b2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'Great question! Through interfaces, yes — a class can implement multiple interfaces and be treated polymorphically as any of those types.'),
